\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {The class-level null on the 60-item random label set.} Pearson correlation with blind human soundness, with bootstrap 95\% CIs, for every signal in the canonical analysis: comparison metrics in orange, verification signals in blue, and LLM judges (expensive comparison points) as hollow markers. \textbf  {Takeaway:} every comparison metric straddles zero while every verification signal grades, and the prefix-repair curve mean sits at the human inter-rater ceiling of $0.79$.}}{4}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
